@title: An action waits for a target that has not arrived yet
# expect-output: price=[$24.50]
STEP 1: Products that arrive after load
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/late.html
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button
    VERIFY that 'Cart: 1' is present
STEP 2: A form that appears after the click
    FILL 'Zip code' field with '01001'
    CLICK the 'Pay' button
    VERIFY that 'Paid, shipping to 01001' is present
STEP 3: Read what arrived
    EXTRACT the 'Price' into {price}
    PRINT "price=[{price}]"
DONE.
